    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.666667</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>The chain rule gives</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle
  \frac{d}{dx}f(g(x))\bigg|_{x=10} = f'(g(10)) g'(10)=
  f'(30) (1) = (0.6667)(1) = 0.6667.</m></p>
</solution>
